.TH FILE_SEARCH_PATTERN 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
file_search_pattern \- search a file for lines containing a pattern
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int file_search_pattern(const char *" filename ", const char *" pattern );
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B file_search_pattern()
function searches
.I filename
line by line for occurrences of the substring
.IR pattern .
Matching lines are printed to standard output along with their line
number.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of matching lines, or \-1 if the file could not be
opened.
.SH AUTHOR
Haseeb
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR file_word_count (3),
.BR file_line_count (3)
